{"candidateAnswer":"Apostle Islands National Lakeshore","evidence":"[D5:8 | 10:47 am on 6 May, 2023] Audrey: That's a good plan! I'm lucky to have a park near me - it's great for my pup's walks. Last Friday we took a road trip - we went to a beautiful national park and my dogs had a blast! It was an awesome trip!\n[D11:9 | 9:48 am on 8 July, 2023] Andrew: Looking forward to seeing them have fun hiking. Let's get planning for next month! Here's the map for the trail.","itemId":"urn:uuid:59a0a3ec-0f5c-52de-b3ef-ed40cfc0d3fb","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:534ceea595316098aa013e29863763479fcab063e96a9601e983a7524440c9da","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Which national park could Audrey and Andrew be referring to in their conversations?","referenceAnswer":"Voyageurs National Park","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"534ceea595316098aa013e29863763479fcab063e96a9601e983a7524440c9da"}}]}